          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau bweyawulira ise by'akobye, yaawowoola inho olw'okunakughala. Yaakoba ise ati: “Bbaaba, nkweghembye zeena onsabire enkabi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Isaaka yaakoba ati: “Muganda wo aidhie yanguya, yaatwala enkabi dho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau yaakoba ati: “Ti kyeyava n'atuumibwa eriina Yakobo? Bwenebwene lyamutuukaaniraku bukalamu, kuba guno omukuzi gwakubiri ng'atwala ekifo kyange. Yantoolaku obukulu bwange obw'okuba omwana omuberi, ni mpegaano bona atoireku enkabi dhange.” Agho yaakoba ati: “Nze tonterekeireyooku ku nkabi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaka yairamu ati: “Mmufiire musengwa wo, era mmughaire baganda be boonaboona babenga bagheereza be, era naamugha engaano n'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu. Kale kiki kye naakukolera iwe, mwana wange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
